From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nowon <nowon@noreply.pepecoin.surf>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 18:23:34 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 158/162] GreatDANE: pass --lazy-cache-dir; no_tlsa is final
 only from the node

In lazy mode the node is launched with --lazy-cache-dir set to the run's
data dir (and GREATDANE_NODE_LAZY_CACHE_DIR). Other lazy tunables stay
at the node's defaults. no_tlsa is treated as final only when the node
returns that status; EDE 22 stays retryable loading.

Adds a localhost e2e harness for a real lazy greatdane-node in a
private netns, with synthetic names only.
